            <note corresp="#d1183-f1" n="39" xml:id="d1183-f1-content">
                <p>Thomas H. Lockett, Counselor of Embassy for Economic Affairs in Mexico, and Wayne
                    C. Taylor, Washington Commissioner.</p>
            </note>
